\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Lord, Thou hast been our 
\par dwelling- place
\par In every generation;
\par Thy people still have known Thy grace,
\par And blessed Thy consolation;
\par Through every age we found Thee
\par nigh,
\par Our strength and our salvation.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Our cleaving sins we oft have wept,
\par And oft Thy patience proved;
\par But still Thy faith we fast have kept;
\par Thy name we still have loved;
\par And Thou hast kept and loved us 
\par well,
\par Hast granted us in Thee to dwell,
\par Unshaken, unremoved.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Lord, nothing from Thine arms 
\par of love
\par Shall Thine own people sever:
\par Our helper never will remove,
\par Our God will fail us never,
\par Thy people, Lord, have dwelt in Thee:
\par Our dwelling- place Thou still wilt be
\par For ever and for ever.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

